{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And Moses said.</b> On the fifteenth day he said \"remember,\" as in <i>and this day shall be to you for a remembrance</i> (above 12:14)." "And the meaning of <i>from the house of slaves</i> is that they would work them as though they were their slaves. And elsewhere it says <i>the iron furnace</i> (Deuteronomy 4:20), for the Egyptians were strong over them, and HaShem brought them out with a strong hand from the strong ones."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:34:02.560795402Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}